Output screenshots/chat.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "cd /Users/wmcginnis/Documents/GitHub/releaseradar"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "RELEASERADAR_START_TAB=4 ./releaseradar"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

# Ask a question
Type "What are the biggest changes in the last week?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 30s

Screenshot screenshots/chat.png

Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
